cla_mmrs: give the code of every action the Action0-3 fields select

Action0 to Action3 said only "Select an Action", so software had to read
the RTL to find which code raises the debug interrupt, halts the clocks,
drives a cross-trigger or steps a counter. The fields now list every code
and say that the unused ones select nothing.

Recorded as a patch so the hand-mirrored upstream/ tree stays
reproducible from the vendored spec plus patches/ applied in order.
diff --git a/rtl/mmr/spec/cla_mmrs.yml b/rtl/mmr/spec/cla_mmrs.yml
index c2ed4de29..78187a3b8 100644
